  "comments": "The BU Uncirculated Sets issued in 1965, which was the last year of minting of the pre-decimal coins, came in three different versions.<br /><br />\r\nThe<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"> Pink Label Set</span> included just ordinary circulation coins that had not gone into circulation.<br />\r\nThe <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Green Label Set</span> included selected circulation coins that had not gone into circulation.<br />\r\nTogether the Pink &amp; Green Label sets had a mintage figure of 175,000 in total.<br /><br />\r\nThe <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Blue Label Set</span> included special selected and polished uncirculated coins. Sometimes described as &quot;Prooflike&quot;.<br />\r\nThe Blue Label set had a mintage of 25,000 in total.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Series obverse die varieties:</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">KM#25.1</span> <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">(1953-56)</span> Without shoulder strap, 88 beads, + pointing at bead;<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59cbe3d68feb3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59cbe3d68feb3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"101\" /></a><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">KM#25.2</span> <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">(1956-65)</span> With shoulder strap, 86 beads, + pointing between beads;<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59cbe3cb33096.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59cbe3cb33096.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"101\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">1956 die varieties:</span><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6061d91def8e6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6061d91def8e6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">1957 obverse die varieties:</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">86 beads</span> Right side of N pointing between pearls, pearls not touching border;<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">87 beads</span> Right side of N pointing at a pearl, pearls touching border.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5dab08221f888.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5dab08221f888.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a>",
